    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>14级 护卫</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>大型 自然界 类人生物</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 140；''重伤'' 70</span><span>''先攻'' +12</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 30，''强韧'' 28，''反射'' 24，''意志'' 26</span><span>''侦查'' +12</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 8</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">长距威胁</div>\n<div class=description>该食人魔无畏者可以对其 2 格内的敌人进行借机攻击。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}巨剑（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 2（一个生物）+19vs.AC<br>命中：1d12+16 伤害，且目标定身直到该食人魔无畏者下回合结束。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">触发动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">无畏者决心✦充能 4,5,6{{$:/dnd/images/four}}{{$:/dnd/images/five}}{{$:/dnd/images/six}}</div>\n<div class=description>触发：该食人魔无畏者的一次豁免掷骰失败。<br>效果（无动作）：该食人魔无畏者重投该豁免掷骰且带有+2 加值。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">欧雷莫奇OGRÉMOCH</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 运动+19</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 24（+14）</span><span>''敏捷'' 16（+10）</span><span>''感知'' 20（+12）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 20（+12）</span><span>''智力'' 8（+7）</span><span>''魅力'' 23（+13）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 混乱邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语，巨人语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 板甲，巨剑</span></div></div>\n</div>",
